api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Aryan-Raj3112/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "content_type": "application/vnd.android.package-archive", "state": "uploaded", "size": 32931124, "digest": "sha256:90fdd749975276405a5b007ef84cb1f71a13a1b8978cbe0242d729db4d928093", "download_count": 218, "created_at": "2026-11-07T07:42:33Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-07T07:43:20Z", "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/Aryan-Raj3112/episteme/releases/download/v1.0.59-oss/Episteme-oss-v1.0.59-oss-releaseOffline.apk"}], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Aryan-Raj3112/episteme/tarball/v1.0.59-oss", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Aryan-Raj3112/episteme/zipball/v1.0.59-oss", "body": "# What's New\r\n\r\n### EPUB reader\r\n\r\n- Added EPUB 3 media overlay narration to \"Listen\".\r\n\r\n### Read-aloud & Listen\r\n\r\n- Added transcript support for media overlay narration in the \"Listen\" overlay.\r\n- Narration now resumes at the last heard passage instead of restarting from the beginning.\r\n- Voice selections now apply audibly right away, including while playback is paused.\r\n- Listen player opening is now separate from auto-start so it no longer jumps into playback.\r\n\r\n### Library\r\n\r\n- Added \"search inside files\": full-text search across your whole library, with per-file snippets and an expandable results view.\r\n- Added a sort control to unified shelves.\r\n- Implemented natural sorting for titles and file names (so \"Book 2\" comes before \"Book 10\").\r\n\r\n### Reader appearance\r\n\r\n- Added per-book local reader themes.\r\n\r\n### Office documents\r\n\r\n- Added support for legacy DOC files.\r\n- Added native DOCX conversion through the office-oxide bridge.\r\n- Shared the PPTX text indexer and rendering model across platforms.\r\n\r\n### PDF reader\r\n\r\n- Increased the maximum PDF zoom scale to 5000%.\r\n- Opaque PDF ink strokes now keep their true color instead of rendering black.\r\n- Centralized annotation export appearance and opacity so annotations look consistent on export.\r\n- Undo and redo of PDF annotations are now persisted.\r\n- The locked camera per PDF view is kept, so reopening restores it.\r\n\r\n### Folder sync & data safety\r\n\r\n- Fixed annotation data loss caused by sidecar race conditions and empty payloads.\r\n- Folder sidecars now keep being written even when cloud sync is off.\r\n- Hardened bookmark persistence against stale snapshot overwrites.\r\n\r\n### Localization\r\n\r\n- Removed stray zero-width spaces from Dutch, Ukrainian and Belarusian strings.\r\n\r\n### Stability & performance\r\n\r\n- Fixed OOM allocations and added a fallback for a missing WebView.\r\n- Stopped offering the smart dictionary upsell in OSS builds.\r\n- General app stability and performance improvements.\r\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Aryan-Raj3112/episteme/releases/437399201/reactions", "total_count": 12, "+1": 7, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 3, "rocket": 1, "eyes": 1}}}